WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.489 --> 00:00:03.931
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:04.111 --> 00:00:06.373
I'm a king cobra.

3
00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:09.835
We are venomous snakes.

4
00:00:09.855 --> 00:00:11.477
What are venomous snakes?

5
00:00:32.188 --> 00:00:35.389
Venomous snakes have a special poison.

6
00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:40.051
The venom is in our fangs.

7
00:00:44.472 --> 00:00:46.753
We can kill our enemies by biting them.

8
00:00:50.034 --> 00:00:51.174
Where do you live?

9
00:00:52.915 --> 00:00:57.096
We live in India, China, and Southeast Asia.

10
00:00:59.424 --> 00:01:02.965
We like rain forests and grasslands.

11
00:01:05.486 --> 00:01:06.526
What do you eat?

12
00:01:08.747 --> 00:01:12.488
King cobras mostly eat other snakes and lizards.

13
00:01:15.348 --> 00:01:18.669
But we can last for days without food.

14
00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:24.591
Sometimes we eat other small animals.

15
00:01:27.012 --> 00:01:28.272
Who are your enemies?

16
00:01:30.024 --> 00:01:32.486
Humans are our biggest enemy.

17
00:01:36.149 --> 00:01:39.251
They destroy our homes and collect us.

18
00:01:42.753 --> 00:01:45.395
How do you protect yourself from humans?

19
00:01:46.636 --> 00:01:49.138
We usually just try to escape.

20
00:01:54.162 --> 00:01:57.024
But we can stand up very tall.

21
00:01:59.892 --> 00:02:02.093
And we can hiss loudly.

22
00:02:07.236 --> 00:02:08.456
Is that your nest?

23
00:02:10.757 --> 00:02:14.479
Yes. Other snakes don't build nests.

24
00:02:17.521 --> 00:02:19.422
But king cobras do.

25
00:02:21.543 --> 00:02:23.604
And we guard them closely!

26
00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:31.925
Uh-oh. I hear footsteps.

27
00:02:33.890 --> 00:02:35.313
I have to protect my eggs.

28
00:02:35.834 --> 00:02:39.884
Hiss! Good-bye, King Cobra!
